    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Generic Power weapon</strong> (standard quality): the type is built in, at no extra cost, and takes no slots.</p><p><strong>Power:</strong> <strong>Critical Injuries:</strong> when it causes one, that injury's Bonus Damage goes up by <strong>5</strong>. <strong>Ricochet:</strong> take <strong>−4</strong> to bounce a shot off cover and hit a target you know about, even behind cover or out of sight, as long as there's a clear path from the bounce point. An Aimed Shot ricochet takes only the Aimed Shot's −8, not the −4 as well. Range is still measured from you to the target. <strong>Shotgun Shells:</strong> pick a surface within 6m/yds as the new origin of the spread, which then covers 6m/yds in a new direction. It can't go through that surface. More in <em>Ricochets in Play</em> (Core Rules, Chapter 07).</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Weapons</small></p>"
